00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.200
We have a hotline from the Gods realm.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.580
It's Gabrie-sama, one of the great angels!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.200
Are you listening, Agariarept-sama?

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:08.040
My master,

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.750
it's Love Love!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:11.960
Oh my!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.060
Fermi.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:20.890
Yes?

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:26.850
No matter how serious it is, I told you not to enter my room without permission.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:29.900
Oh! I'm so sorry!

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.610
That's absolutely correct!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.740
Oh, how could I...

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:40.580
...break into Agariarept-sama's room to find him watching highlight scenes of his favorite Bishoujo Anime-

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.410
Oh, great.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:50.420
Well, I already know what they're calling for.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.550
I'll be leaving.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.050
I'll leave you to guard in my absence.

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.430
Going out?

00:17:58.430 --> 00:17:59.340
How disappointing.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:01.220
Finished already?

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:05.930
Let's escape!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:10.190
It couldn't be helped that we were put under the supervision of Eitarou.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:13.400
We can at least accept the daily chores since it's bound by contract.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:17.360
But the sudden, forced 72 hour labor!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:22.780
The countless acts of sexual harassment with moe chants like a spell!

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:26.000
The humiliation of being exposed like an animal in a freak show.

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.870
I can't stand this treatment anymore!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:33.090
Whatever the reasons, this treatment is unjustifiable!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.210
That's true, but...

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:39.890
But, what do we do about this seal?

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:45.140
We've got to do something about this, otherwise there's no chance of escape.

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.520
That's been dealt with.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.440
I have a trustworthy accomplice.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:54.070
I can let you escape from any jail.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.740
The seal charm is no problem either.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:58.990
I'll prepare counter magic equipment.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.240
R-Really?

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.870
As expected of Baltia!

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.360
The connections you've made during illegal transactions are amazing!

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:05.390
However,

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.250
this is business.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.670
I can't help without a reasonable payment.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.090
I know.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.090
Here.

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:19.800
Three rare figure's of the Samurai Blade Damashii Charm, the whole set.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.470
Okay, right now!

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.680
One as pre-payment.

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.140
The rest after the escape succeeds.

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:31.980
All right.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.070
The mission starts before daybreak tomorrow.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.520
Be prepared.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:42.410
Rather, why are we dressed like this to escape?

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:46.910
If she said this is counter magic equipment, we have no choice.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.710
Sorry for the wait.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.210
Now, this way.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:56.800
What's that expression for?

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.710
Staying all night to make it did pay off!

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.380
It looks nice on you!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.470
Thanks...

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.510
You're like a life-size figure.

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.890
That doesn't make me very happy.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.640
Anyway, let's hurry.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.350
The guard golems will find out.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.280
Though there were some small mishaps,

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:27.330
the escape was mostly successful.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.450
They weren't small!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.160
Being burnt by flames...

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.330
Being exposed to cold winds that might've frozen us to the bone...

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.550
Don't sleep or you'll die!

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:45.140
Somebody save us...

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:50.390
Being carried by rapid waters and falling down a waterfall...

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.100
It was way too dangerous!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.480
Yeah, well, anyway,

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.150
if you get through the hidden portal here,

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:59.940
the mission accomplished.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:03.650
You'll be able to escape to the realm below which is undetectable by the academy.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:07.620
When we go through it, we'll be free...

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.160
We can say goodbye to that hard labor.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.620
Goodbye, Magician's Academy.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:17.040
Goodbye, Sakuma Eitarou.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:23.090
Hey, welcome back, you two.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.340
Where have you two been?

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:29.220
I was worried.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.470
I thought you might've hated work and ran off.

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:40.270
D-Damn you!

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:42.170
You betrayed us!

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.650
Well, um...

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.530
I couldn't go against that man, so well...

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:48.910
In other words...

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:50.330
<b>Now includes diapers
for the elderly!
Pre-First Issue
Together with
the old man too!</b>

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:53.550
I was coerced by the Limited Edition magazine with a figure,

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:56.410
weekly together with the old man, the pre-first issue!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:57.580
That again!

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.460
You double spy!

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.840
Well, that aside...

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:07.180
Forgetting the gratitude of being saved,

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:10.180
and then just trying to escape?

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:13.930
That's absolutely unforgivable, don't you think?

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:17.850
To be frank, this calls for punishment!

00:22:21.060 --> 00:22:22.980
Just kidding.

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.690
Oh, I'm not that demonic.

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:30.320
You two must've had your reasons.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:33.620
I'll try not to trouble you.

00:22:34.490 --> 00:22:37.870
My master~!

00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:48.590
If you finish the work you missed while playing, we'll be even.

00:22:48.590 --> 00:22:53.310
You might not be able to sleep for about 95 hours though...

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:55.430
I'm counting on you, you two.

00:22:55.430 --> 00:23:00.350
No!

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:19.210
That's the place.

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:21.300
It seems so.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:25.800
That bitch!
How could she
snatch
someone
else's man!

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:28.470
Hey, George!

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:28.550
That bitch!
How could she
snatch
someone
else's man!

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:28.590
Hey, George!

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:30.550
No, George.

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:32.430
So fun, George!

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:34.970
George!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:37.560
Metalys, I've realized it...

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:39.390
My true feelings!
